[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4780734423","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120548#issuecomment-4780734423","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120548","id":4780734423,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABHPQ31w","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-23T15:25:11Z","updated_at":"2026-06-23T15:25:11Z","body":"> This forces the inspector to let go of the old object and clean up before the object actually gets wiped from memory.\r\n\r\nDoes it? What's the difference between `edit(nullptr)` and `edit(other_object)`?","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4780734423/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4786040478","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120548#issuecomment-4786040478","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120548","id":4786040478,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABHUUung","user":{"login":"Shaderd00d","id":9315812,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkzMTU4MTI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9315812?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shaderd00d","html_url":"https://github.com/Shaderd00d","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shaderd00d/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shaderd00d/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shaderd00d/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shaderd00d/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shaderd00d/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shaderd00d/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shaderd00d/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shaderd00d/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shaderd00d/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-24T05:00:10Z","updated_at":"2026-06-24T05:02:46Z","body":"> > This forces the inspector to let go of the old object and clean up before the object actually gets wiped from memory.\r\n> \r\n> Does it? What's the difference between `edit(nullptr)` and `edit(other_object)`?\r\n\r\nSorry, that was poorly worded.\r\n\r\nWhen `tile_proxy_object.instantiate(this);` is called, the reference count of the old proxy object becomes zero and it's freed (by thread T0). However, the inspector still tries to interact with it during internal cleanup in edit():\r\n\r\n```\r\n==59428==ERROR: AddressSanitizer: heap-use-after-free on address 0x51300055f690 at pc 0x55559df3d7df bp 0x7fffffff6330 sp 0x7fffffff6328\r\nREAD of size 8 at 0x51300055f690 thread T0\r\n    #0 0x55559df3d7de in Variant::ObjData::ref_pointer(Object*) core/variant/variant.cpp:1103\r\n    #1 0x55559df3dddc in Variant::Variant(Object const*) core/variant/variant.cpp:2510\r\n    #2 0x555591efbb8a in EditorInspector::edit(Object*) editor/inspector/editor_inspector.cpp:5261\r\n    #3 0x5555939527ca in TileSetAtlasSourceEditor::_update_tile_inspector() editor/scene/2d/tiles/tile_set_atlas_source_editor.cpp:615\r\n    ...\r\n\r\n0x51300055f690 is located 16 bytes inside of 384-byte region [0x51300055f680,0x51300055f800)\r\nfreed by thread T0 here:\r\n    #0 0x7ffff78f38f8 in free ../../../../src/libsanitizer/asan/asan_malloc_linux.cpp:52\r\n    #1 0x55559d48f9a9 in Memory::free_static(void*, bool) core/os/memory.cpp:201\r\n```\r\n\r\nCalling `tile_inspector->edit(nullptr);` before the proxy object is instantiated, triggers the inspector to safely disconnect.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4786040478/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5005822996","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120548#issuecomment-5005822996","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120548","id":5005822996,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABKl7MFA","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-17T17:33:29Z","updated_at":"2026-07-17T17:33:29Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5005822996/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5071415996","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120548#issuecomment-5071415996","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120548","id":5071415996,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABLkeqvA","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-24T15:15:48Z","updated_at":"2026-07-24T15:15:48Z","body":"Cherry-picked for 4.7.2.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/